# No type assertions

Do not write `as` assertions such as `as number` or `as unknown`. Narrow with type guards, Zod, or explicit annotations. `as const` is allowed.

```ts
const names = ["settings", "students"] as const;
const parsed: unknown = JSON.parse(text);
```
